  bootwright / controller check
      Verify, without installing or changing anything, the context-independent controller
      prerequisites controller install prepares on this host: its host packages, the controller
      runtime and the state root. It selects no context; the prerequisites a context adds are
      checked by preflight --stage controller and installed by the controller stage of apply.

  Usage
    bootwright controller check [flags]

  Common flags
      --ascii       Use ASCII status markers
      --color       Select terminal colors (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --detail      Select human detail (values: compact, full) · default compact
      -h, --help    Show help for this command
      -o, --output  Select output mode (values: text, json, yaml) · default text
      --progress    Select progress animation (values: auto, always, never) · default auto
      --width       Set presentation width (0: automatic) · default 0

  Examples
    bootwright controller check
